{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16208821","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16208821","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1620882101:1":{"text":"魔、魔物？！我不明白……","source_cn":"魔、魔物？！我不明白……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6826BDC409EF826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620882102:1":{"text":"您不是说，仪式是用来帮助我们获取更强的力量的吗？为什么……为什么会召唤出魔物？","source_cn":"您不是说，仪式是用来帮助我们获取更强的力量的吗？为什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2789754AAA1D99A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620882103:1":{"text":"告诉我，这世界上最强大的力量，是由谁来掌控的呢？","source_cn":"告诉我，这世界上最强大的力量，是由谁来掌控的呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC3A00059762379","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620882104:1":{"text":"神……？","source_cn":"神……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AF67B9E456BFFD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620882105:1":{"text":"不，不是神。那是你我都无法理解的存在。","source_cn":"不，不是神。那是你我都无法理解的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF68FB555EAD1F39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620882106:1":{"text":"但你说得不错，神的确很强大。你所渴慕、所向往的魔力，不过是神眼中的残渣。","source_cn":"但你说得不错，神的确很强大。你所渴慕、所向往的魔力，不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08D95CE3D6B41C7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620882107:1":{"text":"若想要弥补己身的缺陷与瑕疵，需得从神……或是与神相似的存在手中抢夺。","source_cn":"若想要弥补己身的缺陷与瑕疵，需得从神……或是与神相似的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142FC92B95CBF27E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620882108:1":{"text":"老师，您指的究竟是……","source_cn":"老师，您指的究竟是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4049EFC4267C21D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620882109:1":{"text":"恶魔。","source_cn":"恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DEC7B052DB152DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620882110:1":{"text":"那是与神相似的存在。它拥有着你无法想象的强大力量，神能够给你的，恶魔也能够给你。","source_cn":"那是与神相似的存在。它拥有着你无法想象的强大力量，神能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD94F0C2C49216B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620882111:1":{"text":"我们渴慕这种力量，于是秘密结社，进行研究。我们成功了——我们掌握了一种与众不同的、更加伟大的魔法。","source_cn":"我们渴慕这种力量，于是秘密结社，进行研究。我们成功了—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9777ECA3ED89E28E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620882112:1":{"text":"是您向我展示的……那种魔法……","source_cn":"是您向我展示的……那种魔法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5722158C69465B37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620882113:1":{"text":"没错。这就是我们从恶魔与魔物身上获得的力量。","source_cn":"没错。这就是我们从恶魔与魔物身上获得的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E036CC5603F745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620882114:1":{"text":"不像普通的魔力，你只能被动地等待，将神抛下的一点渣滓视作珍宝……这是你可以<style=\"highlight\">主动夺取</style>的力量。","source_cn":"不像普通的魔力，你只能被动地等待，将神抛下的一点渣滓视...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED844CD552979EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620882115:1":{"text":"只要你想，就能凭借它成为世间最强的魔法师，甚至比那些所谓的传奇冒险者们还要强上百倍、千倍！","source_cn":"只要你想，就能凭借它成为世间最强的魔法师，甚至比那些所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BB894AA2FD2B562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620882116:1":{"text":"……可恶……这样的事情……我竟然错过了！！！","source_cn":"……可恶……这样的事情……我竟然错过了！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A6BF3ACF35F417","variant_status":"","ma